@host = https://localhost:7129
# Use http://localhost:5117 if you run the "http" launch profile.

### 0. List accounts (seed: ACC-001, ACC-002)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

# --- ACC-001 (1–2 Oct 2026) ---

### A1. Original trade — expect 201, decision Accepted, isApplied true
POST {{host}}/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-TRX-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### A2. Duplicate re-send — expect 200, decision DuplicateIgnored, isApplied false
POST {{host}}/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-TRX-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### A3. Snapshot 1 Oct — quantity 120, marketValue 22320, unrealizedPnl 72, cash 0, totalValue 22320
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-01
Accept: application/json

